OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA little rain at first in the
OL,6,Fsouth but this soon clearing to leave
OL,7,Fa dry and cold day. Cloudy at first
OL,8,Fbut clearer spells developing from the
OL,9,Fnorth giving some bright or sunny
OL,10,Fintervals later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay dry with largely
OL,13,Fclear skies developing this evening.
OL,14,FRemaining dry and largely clear
OL,15,Fovernight leading to a cold and frosty
OL,16,Fnight. Light winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA mostly dry morning with
OL,19,Fsome bright and sunny spells. Cloudier
OL,20,Fin the afternoon with showers
OL,21,Fspreading southwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
