OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with showers on Friday, which
OL,7,Fmay be wintry. Dry with some long
OL,8,Fsunny spells on Saturday. Cloudier
OL,9,Fwith showers on Sunday. Cold with
OL,10,Ffrosty nights.
